<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Licenze on Luccalug - Lucca Linux User Group</title><link>https://luccalug.it/tags/licenze/</link><description>Recent content in Licenze on Luccalug - Lucca Linux User Group</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>it-IT</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 19:13:58 +0100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luccalug.it/tags/licenze/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Le licenze Creative Commons - Pillole di Free Software</title><link>https://luccalug.it/blog/2014/03/licenze-creative-commons/</link><pubDate>Sat, 08 Mar 2014 00:00:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://luccalug.it/blog/2014/03/licenze-creative-commons/</guid><description>&lt;figure class="figure"&gt;&#10; &lt;picture&gt;&#10; &lt;source&#10; type="image/webp"&#10; srcset="https://luccalug.it/images/blog/licenze-creative-commons/pillole_hu_33070fe3e6c083a7.webp 500w, https://luccalug.it/images/blog/licenze-creative-commons/pillole_hu_33070fe3e6c083a7.webp 500w"&#10; sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px"&gt;&#10; &lt;img&#10; src="https://luccalug.it/images/blog/licenze-creative-commons/pillole.png"&#10; srcset="https://luccalug.it/images/blog/licenze-creative-commons/pillole.png 500w, https://luccalug.it/images/blog/licenze-creative-commons/pillole.png 500w"&#10; sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px"&#10; alt="Locandina ciclo Pillole di Free Software"&#10; width="500"&#10; height="282"&#10; loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"&#10; decoding="async"&gt;&#10; &lt;/picture&gt;&#10; &lt;figcaption&gt;Pillole di Free Software - il ciclo di serate a tema del Luccalug&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Come già annunciato, anche quest&amp;rsquo;anno tornano le serate a tema del ciclo &lt;strong&gt;&amp;ldquo;Pillole di Free Software&amp;rdquo;&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://luccalug.it/tags/pillole-di-free-software/"&gt;tutte le serate del ciclo&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Lunedì sera (&lt;strong&gt;10 Marzo 2014&lt;/strong&gt;) inizieremo con una serata tenuta da &lt;strong&gt;Davide Francesconi&lt;/strong&gt;, che illustrerà il funzionamento delle principali Licenze Libere, con particolare riferimento alle &lt;strong&gt;Creative Commons&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>